# Manifest for run_pipeline_batch.bat
#
# One line per site: site_name,C:\full\path\to\image.tif
# - Lines starting with # are ignored.
# - Blank lines are ignored.
# - The image path does not need to be under data\raw, it can be
#   anywhere on the machine.
# - Do not use a comma inside the site name or the path.
#
# Copy this file to sites.csv (without .example) and edit it with
# your real site names and image paths, then run run_pipeline_batch.bat.

